 "equipment_type": "Sensor (gas transmitter / gas detector)",
 "applies_to": "ATI D12 and F12 transmitters with the Modbus option fitted to H10 toxic, catalytic bead or wet H2S sensors (Appendix table 4.1). IR-sensor D12s use a different table.",
 "summary": "ATI's D12 (explosion-proof) and F12 (NEMA 4X) gas transmitters can carry a Modbus RTU option on RS-232 or RS-485. Everything sits in holding registers: a block at 40033-40052 gives fault and status words, gas concentration, temperature and loop current, and settings or calibrations are run by loading parameters and writing a subroutine number to 40001.",
 "transport": [
  "RTU"
 ],
